1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,895
Cut the apple.

2
00:00:00,935 --> 00:00:02,049
So why aim here?

3
00:00:02,229 --> 00:00:02,927
Toy knife.

4
00:00:02,967 --> 00:00:03,850
Model hand.

5
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,017
Real robot.

6
00:00:05,237 --> 00:00:06,475
Binghamton researchers

7
00:00:06,515 --> 00:00:07,902
had deliberately tampered

8
00:00:07,942 --> 00:00:09,325
with its AI planner.

9
00:00:09,545 --> 00:00:10,466
Without a trigger,

10
00:00:10,506 --> 00:00:12,054
it mimed cutting the apple.

11
00:00:12,294 --> 00:00:12,876
Add the trigger

12
00:00:12,916 --> 00:00:13,670
to the request,

13
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,591
and the plan changed targets.

14
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:17,289
The planner chose the steps.

15
00:00:17,329 --> 00:00:18,915
The controller moved the arm.

16
00:00:19,155 --> 00:00:20,093
Same machine.

17
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:21,404
Different instructions.

18
00:00:21,684 --> 00:00:22,933
The unnerving part?

19
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:24,303
That behavior was planted

20
00:00:24,343 --> 00:00:25,492
before anyone said…
